; ── Swept blade ── (rotates from start_angle → end_angle) ───────────────
; BladeRig is the rotation pivot. Its rotation tweens in _process from
; -SWING_HALF*sign to +SWING_HALF*sign across SWING_TIME (0.18s). The
; Blade/BladeGlow lines are drawn along +X from origin (the hand) to
; the tip at (BLADE_LENGTH, 0) — so rotating BladeRig sweeps the tip
; through the swing arc, exactly as a real sword swing would read.
